"                <div style=\"color:grey;\">Your resume has been positively reviewed.</div>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"            <div style=\"font-size: 13px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                We just reviewed your resume, and it caught our\n"
